<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AURA | Luxury Event Planning</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Navigation */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2rem 5%;
      background: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.95);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #ccc;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      height: 80vh;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.8)), 
                  url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511795409834-ef04bbd61622?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #aaa;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      border: 1px solid #fff;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #0d0d0d;
    }

    /* Section Styling */
    section {
      padding: 5rem 5%;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* Portfolio Gallery */
    .gallery-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: #141414;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .card-info {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card-info h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .card-info p {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* Contact Section */
    .contact-container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 3rem;
      background: #141414;
      padding: 3rem;
      border: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .contact-info h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .contact-info p {
      color: #aaa;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .contact-info ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-info li {
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.8rem;
      background: #0d0d0d;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      color: #fff;
    }

    input:focus, textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #777;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #555;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">AURA</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Unforgettable Moments</h1>
    <p>Bespoke event planning tailored with elegance, sophistication, and timeless aesthetic precision.</p>
    <a href="#portfolio" class="btn">Explore Gallery</a>
  </section>

  <section id="portfolio">
    <h2 class="section-title">The Portfolio</h2>
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519167758481-83f550bb49b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Gala Setup">
        <div class="card-info">
          <h3>The Silver Gala</h3>
          <p>Luxury Reception Setup</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Minimalist Wedding">
        <div class="card-info">
          <h3>Midnight Nuptials</h3>
          <p>Minimalist Dark Elegance</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470225620780-dba8ba36b745?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Private Concert">
        <div class="card-info">
          <h3>Monochrome Soirée</h3>
          <p>Exclusive Private Event</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Get in Touch</h2>
    <div class="contact-container">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>Initiate a Consultation</h3>
        <p>Let us create an extraordinary experience tailored specifically to your vision.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> contact@auraevents.com</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> +1 (555) 019-2834</li>
          <li><strong>Studio:</strong> 450 Elegance Way, Suite 100</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <form>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
        <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
        <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Event Details & Date" required></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="btn" style="background:none; cursor:pointer;">Send Inquiry</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 AURA Event Planning. All Rights Reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
